<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Real, publicly-hosted crawl fixture for the Search Service acceptance
  tests, mirroring local_dev_env/mocks/wiremock/__files/integration_sitemap.xml
  from sitecore.search.search-service's integration test suite.

  The integration test's sitemap only works locally (host.docker.internal,
  behind a local WireMock mock), which real deployed environments (dev/
  staging/prod) cannot reach. This file exists so an acceptance test can
  point a real Search config at a small, fast, stable, publicly-reachable
  site (this one) and crawl/index real content end-to-end, the same way
  the integration test crawls its local mock fixture.
-->
